# For agents working in {{ name }}

Read first: baobab's [PRINCIPLES.md](https://github.com/Cooperation-org/baobab/blob/main/PRINCIPLES.md),
[AGENTS.md](https://github.com/Cooperation-org/baobab/blob/main/AGENTS.md) and
[CONTRACT.md](https://github.com/Cooperation-org/baobab/blob/main/CONTRACT.md).

## This frontend owns no data

- No database. State is the URL, the backend at `VITE_API_URL`, or `localStorage`
  for per-viewer conveniences only.
- Only `src/config.ts` reads `import.meta.env`. No dashboard app hostname or slug anywhere;
  what it knows of a dashboard app comes from `VITE_NAV_SRC`, `VITE_NAV_TAG`, `VITE_THEME_CSS`.
- Every request goes through `src/api.ts`. Writes carry `X-Embed: 1`.

## Cards (`public/embed/`)

- Vanilla JS: no framework, no build step, no shadow DOM. Never import from `src/`.
- The backend is `data-up`; never a hostname in the file.
- Nothing to show (error, signed out, empty): `kit.hide(this)`. No placeholders,
  no error text, no sample data.
- DOM writes by `textContent` and attributes only. Never `innerHTML` with data.
- A card that changes something calls `kit.changed(type, id)`.
- One expand link into the app, from `data-app`. Add each new app URL shape to
  the README's Links; published shapes never change.
